   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function that satisfies \\( f''(x) = x f(x) + \\left(f'(x)\\right)^{2} \\), with \\( f(2) = 1 \\) and \\( f'(2) = 1 \\). Find the third-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 2 \\)."
